{"seq":2,"slug":"functors-applicatives","title":"Functor 与 Applicative","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/functors-applicatives","wordCount":1072,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"functor-与-applicative\">Functor 与 Applicative</h1><p>你有一个 <code>Maybe Int</code>，想给里面的数加一——但它可能是 <code>Nothing</code>，不能直接 <code>+1</code>。你有两个 <code>Maybe Int</code>，想把它们相加——同样不能直接 <code>+</code>。这两个看似琐碎的需求，恰好对应函数式抽象里两级最重要的台阶：Functor 解决「在上下文里映射一个函数」，Applicative 解决「在上下文里应用多参数函数」。讲清楚这两级，下一篇的 Monad 才有支点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把 <code>Maybe</code>、列表、<code>Either e</code>、<code>IO</code> 这些「带上下文的类型构造器」想象成包裹值的盒子。Functor 给盒子一个 <code>fmap</code>：把一个普通函数「钻进盒子」作用到里面的值。Applicative 更进一步，让盒子里也能装函数，并把「盒中函数」应用到「盒中值」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[普通函数 a -&gt; b] --&gt; B[fmap&lt;br/&gt;Functor]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;f a -&gt; f b&lt;br/&gt;映射进上下文&quot;]&#10;  D[上下文中的函数 f &amp;lpar;a-&amp;gt;b&amp;rpar;] --&gt; E[&quot;&amp;lt;*&amp;gt; ap&lt;br/&gt;Applicative&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;f a -&gt; f b&lt;br/&gt;应用进上下文&quot;]&#10;  G[纯值 a] --&gt; H[pure&lt;br/&gt;放进上下文]&#10;  C --&gt; I[处理一个包裹值]&#10;  F --&gt; J[处理多个独立包裹值]&#10;  H --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[普通函数 a -&gt; b] --&gt; B[fmap&lt;br/&gt;Functor]\n  B --&gt; C[\"f a -&gt; f b&lt;br/&gt;映射进上下文\"]\n  D[上下文中的函数 f &amp;lpar;a-&amp;gt;b&amp;rpar;] --&gt; E[\"&amp;lt;*&amp;gt; ap&lt;br/&gt;Applicative\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"f a -&gt; f b&lt;br/&gt;应用进上下文\"]\n  G[纯值 a] --&gt; H[pure&lt;br/&gt;放进上下文]\n  C --&gt; I[处理一个包裹值]\n  F --&gt; J[处理多个独立包裹值]\n  H --&gt; J</pre><p>层级关系很重要：每个 Applicative 都是 Functor，每个 Monad 都是 Applicative。能力逐级增强，约束逐级变强。本篇讲前两级，第三级见 <a href=\"monads\">Monad</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抽象</th>\n<th>核心方法</th>\n<th>能做什么</th>\n<th>关键局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Functor</td>\n<td><code>fmap :: (a-&gt;b) -&gt; f a -&gt; f b</code></td>\n<td>把单参函数映射进上下文</td>\n<td>只能改值，不能改结构/组合上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Applicative</td>\n<td><code>&lt;*&gt; :: f (a-&gt;b) -&gt; f a -&gt; f b</code>、<code>pure</code></td>\n<td>把多参函数应用到多个独立上下文</td>\n<td>后一步不能依赖前一步的结果值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Monad</td>\n<td><code>&gt;&gt;= :: m a -&gt; (a -&gt; m b) -&gt; m b</code></td>\n<td>让后续计算依赖前一步结果</td>\n<td>约束最强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"functor-把函数钻进盒子\">Functor：把函数钻进盒子</h2><p>Functor 类型类只有一个方法 <code>fmap</code>，常用中缀写法 <code>&lt;$&gt;</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"class Functor f where&#10;  fmap :: (a -&gt; b) -&gt; f a -&gt; f b&#10;&#10;(+1) &lt;$&gt; Just 3        -- Just 4&#10;(+1) &lt;$&gt; Nothing       -- Nothing&#10;(*2) &lt;$&gt; [1,2,3]       -- [2,4,6]&#10;show &lt;$&gt; Right 5       -- Right &quot;5&quot;  （Either e 的 Functor 只动 Right）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Functor f where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fmap :: (a -> b) -> f a -> f b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(+1) &#x3C;$> Just 3        -- Just 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(+1) &#x3C;$> Nothing       -- Nothing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(*2) &#x3C;$> [1,2,3]       -- [2,4,6]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>show &#x3C;$> Right 5       -- Right \"5\"  （Either e 的 Functor 只动 Right）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>fmap</code> 的精妙在于它保持上下文不变、只改里面的值：<code>Nothing</code> 映射后还是 <code>Nothing</code>，列表映射后长度不变。这正契合 <a href=\"../foundations/haskell-philosophy\">Haskell 哲学与纯函数式</a> 的纯度直觉——<code>fmap</code> 不偷偷改变盒子的「形状」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"functor-法则\">Functor 法则</h2><p>合法的 Functor 必须满足两条法则（编译器不查，靠你保证），它们保证 <code>fmap</code> 是「老实的映射」而非乱来：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>fmap id</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>id</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fmap}\\ \\text{id} = \\text{id}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">id</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">id</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>fmap </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>∘</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>fmap </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo>∘</mo><mtext>fmap </mtext><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fmap}\\ (g \\circ h) = \\text{fmap}\\ g \\circ \\text{fmap}\\ h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一条说「映射恒等函数等于什么都不做」，第二条说「映射函数复合等于分别映射再复合」。这两条排除了诸如「<code>fmap</code> 顺便复制元素」「<code>fmap</code> 改变结构」这类作弊实现。它们是 <a href=\"typeclasses\">类型类</a> 里讲的「法则即契约」思想的样板，也是 GHC 能基于 Functor 安全做某些优化的依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"applicative-盒子里也能装函数\">Applicative：盒子里也能装函数</h2><p>Functor 卡在哪？试试用 <code>fmap</code> 把两个 <code>Maybe</code> 相加。<code>(+) &lt;$&gt; Just 2</code> 得到的是 <code>Just (2+)</code>——一个装在盒子里的函数！<code>fmap</code> 无法把它应用到 <code>Just 3</code>。这就是 Applicative 登场的契机：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"class Functor f =&gt; Applicative f where&#10;  pure  :: a -&gt; f a&#10;  (&lt;*&gt;) :: f (a -&gt; b) -&gt; f a -&gt; f b&#10;&#10;(+) &lt;$&gt; Just 2 &lt;*&gt; Just 3      -- Just 5&#10;(+) &lt;$&gt; Just 2 &lt;*&gt; Nothing     -- Nothing&#10;pure (+) &lt;*&gt; Just 2 &lt;*&gt; Just 3 -- Just 5&#10;(,) &lt;$&gt; [1,2] &lt;*&gt; [&#39;a&#39;,&#39;b&#39;]    -- [(1,&#39;a&#39;),(1,&#39;b&#39;),(2,&#39;a&#39;),(2,&#39;b&#39;)]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Functor f => Applicative f where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pure  :: a -> f a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (&#x3C;*>) :: f (a -> b) -> f a -> f b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(+) &#x3C;$> Just 2 &#x3C;*> Just 3      -- Just 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(+) &#x3C;$> Just 2 &#x3C;*> Nothing     -- Nothing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pure (+) &#x3C;*> Just 2 &#x3C;*> Just 3 -- Just 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(,) &#x3C;$> [1,2] &#x3C;*> ['a','b']    -- [(1,'a'),(1,'b'),(2,'a'),(2,'b')]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>pure</code> 把纯值塞进上下文，<code>&lt;*&gt;</code> 把「盒中函数」应用到「盒中值」。<code>&lt;$&gt;</code> 起头、<code>&lt;*&gt;</code> 串联，就能把任意多参纯函数提升进上下文，处理任意多个独立的包裹值。校验表单（收集多个可能失败的字段）是 Applicative 的经典舞台。</p>\n<h2 id=\"applicative-的天花板\">Applicative 的天花板</h2><p>Applicative 有个根本局限，恰恰是 Monad 存在的理由：它的多个计算彼此独立，后一步无法依赖前一步算出的值。</p>\n<p><code>(+) &lt;$&gt; readInt &lt;*&gt; readInt</code> 里，第二个 <code>readInt</code> 不能根据第一个的结果决定要不要读、读什么。结构上，Applicative 的「效应」在运行前就固定了，只是把独立结果组合起来。一旦你需要「先读一个数 n，再读 n 个数」这种依赖前值的控制流，Applicative 就无能为力。这道天花板把我们自然推向 <a href=\"monads\">Monad</a>——它用 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 让后续计算成为前一步结果的函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实用模式-traverse-与-sequencea\">实用模式：traverse 与 sequenceA</h2><p>Applicative 最常被低估的实战价值在 <code>Traversable</code>。<code>traverse :: Applicative f =&gt; (a -&gt; f b) -&gt; t a -&gt; f (t b)</code> 能把「对每个元素做一个带上下文的操作」整齐地翻转结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"traverse safeDiv10 [2,5,10]   -- safeDiv10 :: Int -&gt; Maybe Int&#10;-- Just [5,2,1]               全部成功才 Just，任一 Nothing 则整体 Nothing&#10;sequenceA [Just 1, Just 2, Nothing]   -- Nothing\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>traverse safeDiv10 [2,5,10]   -- safeDiv10 :: Int -> Maybe Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Just [5,2,1]               全部成功才 Just，任一 Nothing 则整体 Nothing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sequenceA [Just 1, Just 2, Nothing]   -- Nothing</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这一模式把「一串可能失败的操作汇总成一个整体成功或失败」写得极简，是处理列表化校验、批量 IO 的日常利器，背后正是 Applicative 把独立效应组合的能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Functor 用 <code>fmap</code>/<code>&lt;$&gt;</code> 把单参函数映射进上下文，保持上下文形状不变。</li>\n<li>Functor 须满足两条法则：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>fmap id</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>id</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fmap}\\ \\text{id}=\\text{id}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">id</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">id</span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>fmap </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>∘</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>fmap </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo>∘</mo><mtext>fmap </mtext><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fmap}\\ (g\\circ h)=\\text{fmap}\\ g\\circ\\text{fmap}\\ h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>Applicative 用 <code>pure</code> 与 <code>&lt;*&gt;</code> 把多参函数应用到多个独立上下文，是表单校验等场景的主力。</li>\n<li>Applicative 的天花板：多步计算互相独立，后一步不能依赖前一步的结果值。</li>\n<li><code>traverse</code>/<code>sequenceA</code> 把「一串带上下文的操作」翻转汇总，是高频实战模式。</li>\n<li>这道天花板把我们引向 <a href=\"monads\">Monad</a>；而法则思想承接自 <a href=\"typeclasses\">类型类</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Functor 与 Applicative","id":"functor-与-applicative"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Functor：把函数钻进盒子","id":"functor-把函数钻进盒子"},{"level":2,"text":"Functor 法则","id":"functor-法则"},{"level":2,"text":"Applicative：盒子里也能装函数","id":"applicative-盒子里也能装函数"},{"level":2,"text":"Applicative 的天花板","id":"applicative-的天花板"},{"level":2,"text":"实用模式：traverse 与 sequenceA","id":"实用模式-traverse-与-sequencea"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/typeclasses"},"next":{"title":"Monad 单子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/monads"}}